chedule.* > > *(4) Schedule 7, page 169 (line 1) to page 188 (line 29), omit the Schedule.*","result":"negative","slug":"division-federal-representatives-9414","source_url":"https://theyvoteforyou.org.au/divisions/representatives/2024-11-20/5"}
